        "original_id": "053007b1-3de1-5d33-ba67-7b9d5616c831",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Revengers Tragedy, The Revenger's Tragedy\n- People: Thomas Middleton, Christopher Eccleston, Derek Jacobi, Eddie Izzard, Diana Quick, Andrew Schofield, Carla Henry, Marc Warren, Justin Salinger\n- Roles: Vindice, Duke, Lussurioso, Duchess, Carlo, Hippolito, Castiza, Supervacuo, Ambitioso\n\nFacts:\n- The Revenger's Tragedy is a 1606 play that the film Revengers Tragedy adapts.\n- The credits of Revengers Tragedy attribute The Revenger's Tragedy to Thomas Middleton, following current scholarly consensus.\n- Diana Marilyn Quick was born on 23 November 1946.\n- Diana Marilyn Quick is an English actress.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Christopher Eccleston as Vindice, a revenge-obsessed character.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Derek Jacobi as the Duke.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Eddie Izzard as Lussurioso, the Duke's lecherous son.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Diana Quick as the Duchess.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Andrew Schofield as Carlo, Vindice's brother, a version of the play's Hippolito.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Carla Henry as Castiza, Vindice's virtuous sister.\n- Revengers Tragedy stars Marc Warren and Justin Salinger as Supervacuo and Ambitioso, the Duchess's sons.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b87bab76-bd2a-5a9c-a7f1-0fddf3a9e7e8",
        "text": "Page: Revengers Tragedy. Sentence: Revengers Tragedy is a film adaptation of the 1606 play \"The Revenger's Tragedy\" (attributed to Thomas Middleton in the credits, following the current scholarly consensus).\nPage: Revengers Tragedy. Sentence: The film stars Christopher Eccleston as the revenge-obsessed Vindice, with Derek Jacobi as the evil Duke, Eddie Izzard as his lecherous son Lussurioso, Diana Quick as the Duchess, Andrew Schofield as Vindice's brother Carlo (a version of the play's Hippolito), Carla Henry as his virtuous sister Castiza, and Marc Warren and Justin Salinger as the Duchess's sons Supervacuo and Ambitioso.\nPage: Diana Quick. Sentence: Diana Marilyn Quick (born 23 November 1946) is an English actress.",
